    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRIVE. SMASH. SURVIVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Hogtagon - a brutal vehicular battleground where only the strongest survive. In this high-octane driving sumo-inspired game, 2-8 players battle in deadly arena to be the last hog standing. You may not understand the cosmic force that summoned you to the arena, but one thought emanates through your mind - victory at all costs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHAOS ON WHEELS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command powerful vehicles in a desperate struggle for dominance. Master the art of vehicular combat as you strategically ram, push, and outmaneuver your opponents, sending them flying into the abyss below. Every collision brings you closer to victory - or doom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Vehicular Sumo Battles</strong>: Crash, smash and bash your opponents off the arena in fast-paced matches where quick reflexes and tactical thinking determine the champion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong>: Play free-for-all or team-based matches with 2-8 players online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Responsive Physics</strong>: Pilot your hog and experience visceral collision mechanics that make every impact feel powerful and consequential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hogtagon awaits. Will you seize glory or be hurled into oblivion?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRIVE. SMASH. SURVIVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Hogtagon - a brutal vehicular battleground where only the strongest survive. In this high-octane driving sumo-inspired game, 2-8 players battle in deadly arena to be the last hog standing. You may not understand the cosmic force that summoned you to the arena, but one thought emanates through your mind - victory at all costs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHAOS ON WHEELS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command powerful vehicles in a desperate struggle for dominance. Master the art of vehicular combat as you strategically ram, push, and outmaneuver your opponents, sending them flying into the abyss below. Every collision brings you closer to victory - or doom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Vehicular Sumo Battles</strong>: Crash, smash and bash your opponents off the arena in fast-paced matches where quick reflexes and tactical thinking determine the champion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong>: Play free-for-all or team-based matches with 2-8 players online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Responsive Physics</strong>: Pilot your hog and experience visceral collision mechanics that make every impact feel powerful and consequential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hogtagon awaits. Will you seize glory or be hurled into oblivion?</p>",
    "short_description": "Hogtagon is an action-packed vehicular sumo game where 2-8 players crash into each other in a deadly arena - The Hogtagon. Knock opponents off the edge, be the last hog standing, and dominate in free-for-all or team-based online matches with physics that make every impact count.",
